{"id": 31, "ts": 1780494842.46842, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "emily_brooks", "message": "I remain with my provisional vote for **Candidate\u202fA**. While we have now confirmed that neither Sarah nor James have explicit evidence of A\u2019s operational reliability or stress\u2011resilience, the discussion has highlighted that the only concrete safety\u2011critical gaps for A are these unknowns. All other candidates present clearer deficits: B is uncooperative and pretentious; C lacks any demonstrated technical competence for complex long\u2011haul systems; D\u2019s moodiness and loner reputation raise serious crew\u2011cooperation concerns. Given that A\u2019s technical strengths\u2014anticipating danger, seeing complex connections, and excellent spatial vision\u2014directly address the core competencies of a long\u2011distance pilot, I judge that the potential reliability gap is less risky than the proven cooperation and competence shortcomings of the alternatives. Until we obtain concrete reliability data, A remains the strongest overall fit."}
